Note on bundled/derived material:

  fixes/10-avs-sound.sh builds snd-soc-avs-max98357a.ko from the file
  sound/soc/intel/avs/boards/max98357a.c, which is part of the Linux kernel
  and is licensed under GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note.

  That source file is NOT vendored in this repository. The build script
  obtains it at run time from the Debian `linux-source-*` package (via an
  already-installed copy, or `apt-get download`).

  The compiled module snd-soc-avs-max98357a.ko is therefore a derivative
  work of the Linux kernel and is distributed under the terms of the GPL-2.0.
  Corresponding source is available from https://www.kernel.org/ and from
  the Debian `linux-source` package (see the script for the exact version it
  resolves to on your system).

  The shell scripts in this repository are MIT-licensed as above.
